--TEST--
`prepareRename` on an enum's own declaration answers the range of its name alone, without the backing type, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
enum Sta<|>tus: int
{
    case Draft = 1;
    case Live = 2;
}

var $s = Status::Draft;
--REQUEST--
prepareRename
--EXPECT--
case.nvs:2:6-2:12
